```

---

## 🧹 Reset MongoDB Data (Danger Zone)

This will delete all MongoDB data:

```bash
docker compose down -v
docker volume rm mongodb_data
```

---

## 🧠 Notes for Developers

* Data persists via Docker volume (`mongodb_data`)
* Port `27017` must be free on your machine
* Works with Node.js, Python, Java, etc.
* Works inside WSL and Windows/macOS natively

